<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/woofy-theme.css" />
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css" />
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/static-pages.css" />
<%- include("../partials/header") %>

<main class="container">
  <!-- Hero Banner -->
  <div class="static-hero">
    <div class="hero-badge"><i class="fas fa-paw"></i> About Woofy</div>
    <h1>Our Mission is to <span>Connect Hearts</span></h1>
    <p>We believe every dog deserves a loving home. Woofy is your trusted companion in finding the perfect breed that matches your lifestyle, family, and heart.</p>
  </div>

  <!-- Our Story -->
  <div class="static-section">
    <div class="static-section-title">
      <h2><i class="fas fa-book-open" style="color:var(--primary-dark);margin-right:8px;"></i> Our Story</h2>
      <p>How Woofy came to be — and where we're headed.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="about-story">
      <p>Founded by a team of dog lovers and pet industry experts, Woofy was born from a simple observation: choosing the right dog breed is one of the most important decisions a family can make. We wanted to create a platform that makes this decision easier, more informed, and ultimately more rewarding.</p>
      <p>Today, Woofy serves thousands of future pet owners every month, helping them discover the joy of responsible pet ownership through education and informed decision-making. We continue to grow our database, refine our search tools, and build a community of informed, passionate dog lovers.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Mission & Vision -->
  <div class="static-section">
    <div class="static-section-title">
      <h2><i class="fas fa-bullseye" style="color:var(--primary-dark);margin-right:8px;"></i> Our Mission & Vision</h2>
      <p>Driven by a passion for connecting people with their ideal canine companions.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="about-mv-grid">
      <div class="about-mv-card">
        <div class="mv-icon"><i class="fas fa-crosshairs"></i></div>
        <h3>Our Mission</h3>
        <p>To empower future pet owners with comprehensive, accurate breed information so they can make informed decisions and find the perfect four-legged family member.</p>
        <span class="mv-tag"><i class="fas fa-graduation-cap"></i> Education First</span>
      </div>
      <div class="about-mv-card">
        <div class="mv-icon"><i class="fas fa-eye"></i></div>
        <h3>Our Vision</h3>
        <p>A world where every dog finds a loving, well-matched home — and every family discovers the joy of responsible pet ownership through knowledge and preparation.</p>
        <span class="mv-tag"><i class="fas fa-home"></i> Happier Homes</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Why Choose Woofy -->
  <div class="static-section">
    <div class="static-section-title">
      <h2><i class="fas fa-star" style="color:var(--primary-dark);margin-right:8px;"></i> Why Choose Woofy?</h2>
      <p>Four pillars that make us your most trusted breed resource.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="about-values-grid">
      <div class="about-value-card">
        <span class="val-icon">📚</span>
        <h4>Comprehensive Database</h4>
        <p>Detailed information on hundreds of dog breeds, from temperament to care requirements.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="about-value-card">
        <span class="val-icon">🔍</span>
        <h4>Smart Search</h4>
        <p>Find your perfect match by filtering breeds by size, temperament, origin, and more.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="about-value-card">
        <span class="val-icon">❤️</span>
        <h4>Save Favorites</h4>
        <p>Keep track of breeds you love and compare them side by side to make the best choice.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="about-value-card">
        <span class="val-icon">👨‍👩‍👧‍👦</span>
        <h4>Family-Focused</h4>
        <p>Information tailored to help families find the perfect furry friend for their unique needs.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Statistics -->
  <div class="static-section">
    <div class="static-section-title">
      <h2><i class="fas fa-chart-line" style="color:var(--primary-dark);margin-right:8px;"></i> Woofy by the Numbers</h2>
      <p>Our growing community of dog lovers.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="about-stats">
      <div class="about-stat-card">
        <div class="stat-icon">🐾</div>
        <div class="stat-number">200+</div>
        <div class="stat-label">Dog Breeds</div>
      </div>
      <div class="about-stat-card">
        <div class="stat-icon">👥</div>
        <div class="stat-number">50K+</div>
        <div class="stat-label">Happy Users</div>
      </div>
      <div class="about-stat-card">
        <div class="stat-icon">📅</div>
        <div class="stat-number">10+</div>
        <div class="stat-label">Years Experience</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Meet the Team -->
  <div class="static-section">
    <div class="static-section-title">
      <h2><i class="fas fa-users" style="color:var(--primary-dark);margin-right:8px;"></i> Meet the Team</h2>
      <p>The passionate people behind Woofy.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="about-team-grid">
      <div class="about-team-card">
        <div class="team-avatar"><i class="fas fa-user-tie"></i></div>
        <h4>Sarah Chen</h4>
        <div class="team-role">Founder & CEO</div>
        <p>15 years in pet tech and a lifelong dog lover. Sarah founded Woofy to make breed research accessible to everyone.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="about-team-card">
        <div class="team-avatar"><i class="fas fa-user-md"></i></div>
        <h4>Dr. Mark Rivera</h4>
        <div class="team-role">Chief Veterinary Advisor</div>
        <p>Veterinarian with over 12 years of clinical experience. Mark ensures all breed data is accurate and up-to-date.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="about-team-card">
        <div class="team-avatar"><i class="fas fa-paint-brush"></i></div>
        <h4>Emily Torres</h4>
        <div class="team-role">Head of Design</div>
        <p>Passionate about crafting intuitive experiences. Emily makes sure Woofy is as beautiful as it is functional.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Call to Action -->
  <div class="about-cta">
    <h2>Find Your Perfect Companion</h2>
    <p>Start exploring our breed database and discover the dog that's right for you and your family.</p>
    <a href="/user/breeds" class="btn-cta"><i class="fas fa-paw"></i> Browse Breeds</a>
  </div>
</main>

<%- include("../partials/footer") %>